  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Personalbidrag till EUDC</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Seconded personell to EUDC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kriminalv&#xe5;rdens personal ska bidra till genomf&#xf6;randet av insatsens uppdrag</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Personell contributions from the Swedish Prison and Probation Service shall contribute to the missions.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kriminalv&#xe5;rdens uts&#xe4;nde ansvarar f&#xf6;r utbildning och utbildningsutveckling f&#xf6;r medarbetare till CSPP missionerna i t.ex Somalia, Mali, Palestina och Irak. En del av syftet &#xe4;r &#xe4;ven att st&#xe4;rka de nationella kriminalv&#xe5;rdskomponenterna via dessa utbildningar.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Responsibility for the development and delivery of trainings to staff members from the CSDP missions in for example Somalia, Mali, Palestine and Iraq. Part of the aim for the secondment is to strengthen the corrections component within these international civilian crisis missions. Stationed at the ESDC in Brussels.</narrative>
  </description>
